# V2 box-model profile
@profile-version 2
@layout projection 4:3

@font-family American Typewriter, Courier New, Monospace
@font-size 1.5
@line-spacing 0.30

@frame-width 0.5
@padding exterior 1.0, interior 1.0

@background-color #000000
@text-color exterior #FFFFFF
@text-color interior #FFFFFF

@box interior bottom left when any(copyright,license)
$copyright
